        "id_external_80_000_hours": "The Good Food Institute",
        "description": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.gfi.org\">The Good Food Institute</a> (GFI) is a nonprofit think tank that aims to make the global food system better for the planet, people, and animals. Alongside scientists, businesses, and policymakers, GFI\u2019s teams focus on trying to make plant-based and cultivated meat delicious, affordable, and accessible.</p>",
