    "title": "Partnership Lead, Clinical Trial Abundance",
    "post": {
      "company": {
        "name": "1Day Sooner",
        "id_external_80_000_hours": "1Day Sooner",
        "description": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.onedaysooner.org/\">1Day Sooner</a> (1Day) is a nonprofit that advocates for people who participate and want to participate in high-impact medical studies. They particularly focus on human challenge trials, where healthy volunteers are infected with a disease to test a vaccine, treatment, or to learn other important information. They also work on advocacy and research for advanced market commitments, indoor air quality, and global health equity.</p>",
